-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/CNAL2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Basalt and trace conglomerate and pyroxene-phyric basalt. Stratified bedrock. Occurs onshore. Deposited during the Eocene Epoch (Palaeogene Period) (56-33.9 Ma BP)."@en .
